---
// Montenegro – inspirationssida
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="sv">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Montenegro — MediteranoBay</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Där berg möter hav och varje dag bjuder på något nytt. Autentiskt, vackert och nära." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://mediteranobay.com/montenegro" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="Montenegro — MediteranoBay" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="Där berg möter hav och varje dag bjuder på något nytt. Autentiskt, vackert och nära." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://mediteranobay.com/images/kotorbukten.jpg" />
  <meta property="og:locale" content="sv_SE" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #0b3c5d;
      --navy-dark: #071e2e;
      --gold: #c9a227;
      --gold-light: #e8bb3d;
      --gold-dark: #a88420;
    }
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      color: #1a1a2e;
      background: #fff;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .fade-up {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(24px);
      transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease;
    }
    .fade-up.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    .delay-1 { transition-delay: 0.1s; }
    .delay-2 { transition-delay: 0.2s; }
    .delay-3 { transition-delay: 0.3s; }
    .delay-4 { transition-delay: 0.4s; }

    /* ===== NAV ===== */
    #navbar { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.97); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.07); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); }
    .nav-inner { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; height: 68px; }
    .nav-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; }
    .nav-logo-icon { width: 34px; height: 34px; background: var(--navy); border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .nav-logo-wordmark { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .nav-logo-name { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: var(--navy); line-height: 1.1; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .nav-logo-sub { font-size: 8px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: #9ca3af; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.2; }
    .nav-links { display: none; align-items: center; gap: 28px; }
    .nav-links a { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #374151; text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--navy); }
    .nav-links a[aria-current="page"] { color: var(--gold); }
    .nav-cta { background: var(--gold); color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap; }
    .nav-cta:hover { background: var(--gold-dark); }
    .hamburger { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; padding: 4px; background: none; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
    .hamburger span { width: 22px; height: 2px; background: #374151; border-radius: 2px; display: block; }
    .mobile-menu { display: none; border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6; padding: 12px 24px 16px; background: #fff; }
    .mobile-menu a { display: block; padding: 10px 0; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #374151; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #f3f4f6; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .mobile-menu a:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

    /* ===== HERO ===== */
    .hero { position: relative; min-height: 88vh; display: flex; align-items: center; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 68px; }
    .hero-img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center 40%; }
    .hero-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(7,30,46,0.68) 45%, rgba(7,30,46,0.22) 100%); }
    .hero-scroll { position: absolute; bottom: 32px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: 3; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; opacity: 0.6; }
    .hero-scroll-line { width: 1px; height: 40px; background: #fff; animation: scrollpulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite; }
    @keyframes scrollpulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scaleY(1); } 50% { opacity: 1; transform: scaleY(1.2); } }
    .hero-content { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 32px; width: 100%; }
    .hero-kicker { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.24em; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .hero-title { font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5.2rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.02; color: #fff; letter-spacing: -0.03em; max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .hero-sub { font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 1.5vw, 1.1rem); color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); max-width: 400px; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 36px; }
    .btn-gold { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: var(--gold); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; border: none; cursor: pointer; }
    .btn-gold:hover { background: var(--gold-dark); }
    .btn-outline-white { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.5); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; padding: 13px 26px; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .btn-outline-white:hover { border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); }
    .hero-btns { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }

    /* ===== VARFÖR SECTION ===== */
    .varfor-section { padding: 96px 32px; background: #fff; }
    .section-inner { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .section-kicker { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .section-title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; color: #0d2235; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.025em; margin-bottom: 56px; max-width: 600px; }
    .varfor-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 48px; }
    .varfor-item {}
    .varfor-icon { width: 40px; height: 40px; margin-bottom: 18px; color: var(--gold); }
    .varfor-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; color: #0d2235; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .varfor-desc { font-size: 13px; color: #6b7280; line-height: 1.75; }

    /* ===== PLACE SPLIT SECTIONS ===== */
    .place-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; min-height: 580px; }
    .place-dark { background: #0d2235; padding: 88px 72px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
    .place-kicker { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .place-title { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 2.8vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 800; color: #fff; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .place-desc { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.62); line-height: 1.85; max-width: 360px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .place-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--gold); text-decoration: none; text-transform: uppercase; transition: gap 0.2s; }
    .place-link:hover { gap: 14px; color: var(--gold-light); }
    .place-img { overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
    .place-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform 0.7s ease; }
    .place-section:hover .place-img img { transform: scale(1.03); }

    /* ===== AKTIVITETER ===== */
    .activity-section { padding: 96px 32px; background: #f8f6f1; }
    .activity-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; margin-top: 48px; }
    .activity-item { position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; }
    .activity-item img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/3; object-fit: cover; display: block; transition: transform 0.5s ease; }
    .activity-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.05); }
    .activity-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(7,30,46,0.65) 0%, transparent 55%); }
    .activity-label { position: absolute; bottom: 18px; left: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; }

    /* ===== MAT & VIN ===== */
    .food-section { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; min-height: 540px; }
    .food-img { overflow: hidden; position: relative; }
    .food-img img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
    .food-dark { background: #0d2235; padding: 88px 72px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; }
    .food-kicker { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .food-title { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 2.8vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 800; color: #fff; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .food-desc { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.62); line-height: 1.85; max-width: 360px; }

    /* ===== NÄR SKA MAN RESA ===== */
    .season-section { padding: 96px 32px; background: #fff; }
    .season-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 2px; margin-top: 48px; }
    .season-item { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
    .season-item img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 3/4; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
    .season-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(7,30,46,0.82) 0%, rgba(7,30,46,0.1) 60%); }
    .season-body { position: absolute; bottom: 28px; left: 24px; right: 24px; }
    .season-name { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: var(--gold); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .season-months { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
    .season-desc { font-size: 12px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); line-height: 1.6; }

    /* ===== FAQ ===== */
    .faq-section { padding: 96px 32px; background: #f8f6f1; }
    .faq-list { max-width: 760px; margin: 48px auto 0; }
    .faq-item { border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(13,34,53,0.1); }
    .faq-question { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 24px; padding: 22px 0; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #0d2235; line-height: 1.4; user-select: none; }
    .faq-icon { flex-shrink: 0; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--navy); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; transition: transform 0.3s, background 0.2s; }
    .faq-icon svg { color: #fff; transition: transform 0.3s; }
    .faq-item.open .faq-icon { background: var(--gold); }
    .faq-item.open .faq-icon svg { transform: rotate(45deg); }
    .faq-answer { max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.35s ease, padding 0.35s; }
    .faq-answer p { font-size: 14px; color: #4b5563; line-height: 1.8; padding-bottom: 22px; max-width: 640px; }
    .faq-item.open .faq-answer { max-height: 300px; }

    /* ===== CONTACT SECTION ===== */
    .contact-section { position: relative; background: #0d2235; overflow: hidden; }
    .contact-bg-img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; opacity: 0.12; }
    .contact-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 96px 32px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
    .contact-title { font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; color: #fff; line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -0.025em; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .contact-desc { font-size: 14px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); line-height: 1.8; max-width: 360px; }
    .contact-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
    .form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
    .form-field { width: 100%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95); border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 4px; padding: 12px 14px; font-size: 13px; font-family: inherit; outline: none; color: #1a1a2e; }
    .form-field::placeholder { color: #9ca3af; }
    .form-field:focus { border-color: var(--gold); }
    textarea.form-field { resize: vertical; min-height: 100px; }
    .btn-gold-full { width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 10px; background: var(--gold); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; text-transform: uppercase; border: none; cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit; }
    .btn-gold-full:hover { background: var(--gold-dark); }

    /* ===== FOOTER ===== */
    .footer { background: var(--navy); padding: 64px 32px 32px; }
    .footer-inner { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; margin-bottom: 48px; }
    .footer-logo-wrap { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    .footer-logo-icon { width: 34px; height: 34px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    .footer-logo-name { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: #fff; }
    .footer-tagline { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .social-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
    .social-btn { width: 34px; height: 34px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; text-decoration: none; transition: background 0.2s; }
    .social-btn:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2); }
    .footer-col-label { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.2em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .footer-links { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 9px; }
    .footer-links a { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.58); text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: #fff; }
    .footer-links li span { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.58); }
    .footer-bottom { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 24px; font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    .footer-bottom a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); text-decoration: none; }
    .footer-bottom a:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }

    /* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */
    @media (min-width: 1024px) {
      .nav-links { display: flex; }
      .hamburger { display: none; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 1023px) {
      .varfor-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 32px; }
      .place-dark { padding: 64px 40px; }
      .food-dark { padding: 64px 40px; }
      .activity-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .season-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .hero { min-height: 80vh; }
      .varfor-section { padding: 64px 24px; }
      .varfor-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 28px; }
      .place-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .place-img { min-height: 300px; }
      .place-dark { padding: 56px 24px; }
      .activity-section { padding: 64px 24px; }
      .activity-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 8px; }
      .food-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .food-img { min-height: 300px; }
      .food-dark { padding: 56px 24px; }
      .season-section { padding: 64px 24px; }
      .season-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .faq-section { padding: 64px 24px; }
      .contact-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; padding: 64px 24px; }
      .form-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 28px; }
      .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- ========== NAVIGATION ========== -->
<nav id="navbar">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="/" class="nav-logo" aria-label="MediteranoBay hem">
      <div class="nav-logo-icon">
        <span style="color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-1px;">M</span>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-logo-wordmark">
        <span class="nav-logo-name">MEDITERANOBAY</span>
        <span class="nav-logo-sub">Företagsupplevelser i Montenegro</span>
      </div>
    </a>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="/upplevelser">Upplevelser</a>
      <a href="/montenegro" aria-current="page">Montenegro</a>
      <a href="/blog">Journal</a>
      <a href="/om">Om oss</a>
      <a href="#kontakt">Kontakt</a>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;">
      <a href="#kontakt" class="nav-cta">BOKA MÖTE</a>
      <button class="hamburger" id="menu-btn" aria-label="Öppna meny" aria-expanded="false">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mobile-menu" id="mobile-menu">
    <a href="/upplevelser">Upplevelser</a>
    <a href="/montenegro" aria-current="page">Montenegro</a>
    <a href="/blog">Journal</a>
    <a href="/om">Om oss</a>
    <a href="#kontakt">Kontakt</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ========== HERO ========== -->
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-h1">
  <img class="hero-img" src="/images/kotorbukten.jpg" alt="Kotorbukten, Montenegro" />
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="hero-scroll" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="hero-scroll-line"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="hero-kicker fade-up">Destination</div>
    <h1 id="hero-h1" class="hero-title fade-up delay-1">
      Montenegro.
    </h1>
    <p class="hero-sub fade-up delay-2">
      En destination med oändliga möjligheter. Där berg möter hav och varje dag bjuder på något nytt.
    </p>
    <div class="hero-btns fade-up delay-3">
      <a href="#kontakt" class="btn-gold">
        PLANERA ER RESA
        <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#destinationer" class="btn-outline-white">
        UTFORSKA
        <svg width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========== VARFÖR MONTENEGRO ========== -->
<section class="varfor-section" id="destinationer">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="fade-up">
      <div class="section-kicker">Varför Montenegro</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Där natur, historia och hav<br />möts på en och samma plats.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="varfor-grid">
      <div class="varfor-item fade-up delay-1">
        <svg class="varfor-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M3 17l4-8 4 4 3-6 4 10H3z"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="varfor-title">Natur i världsklass</div>
        <div class="varfor-desc">UNESCO-skyddade vikar, djupa kanjoner och alpina bergstoppar — allt inom ett par timmars avstånd.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="varfor-item fade-up delay-2">
        <svg class="varfor-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M4.22 4.22l1.42 1.42M18.36 18.36l1.42 1.42M2 12h2M20 12h2M4.22 19.78l1.42-1.42M18.36 5.64l1.42-1.42"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="varfor-title">300 soldagar om året</div>
        <div class="varfor-desc">Medelhavsklimat från maj till oktober. Varmt, soligt och med perfekta förhållanden för utomhusaktiviteter.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="varfor-item fade-up delay-3">
        <svg class="varfor-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M12 2C8.13 2 5 5.13 5 9c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13c0-3.87-3.13-7-7-7z"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.5"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="varfor-title">Autentiskt och nära</div>
        <div class="varfor-desc">Tre timmar från Stockholm med direktflyg. Äkta Adriatisk atmosfär utan massturism.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="varfor-item fade-up delay-4">
        <svg class="varfor-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
